cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this portal, please cite it as below.
title: "Young Person 360º: before the label. Children and young people held, lost or unseen by the system, across the UK"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Young Person 360º contributors"
repository-code: https://github.com/cyberdudeuk/young-person-360
url: https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/young-person-360/
abstract: >-
  An evidence-led, pan-UK view of every child and young person the state holds, loses or never sees, from birth: the
  cohorts, the records kept about them, where those records break, and the departure events where a young person
  leaves oversight. It introduces BEET and CHEET as the states before NEET. Every figure traces to its source. A
  prototype, not an official government service.
keywords: [children, young people, BEET, CHEET, NEET, looked-after children, children not in school, UK government]
license: [MIT, OGL-UK-3.0]
version: 1.6.0
date-released: 2026-11-22
